<h2 align="center">Trade Skills </h2>

<p>Greetings Friends and Neighbors! </p>
<p>Welcome to the trade skill portion of the Random Acts Home on the Web. Here you
will find the information you need whether you are looking to start working on you 
own skills or find just the right crafter for your shopping needs.</p>
<p> Links to Trade Skill sites:
<ol>
   <li> <a href=http://www.eqtraders.com/>EQTraders.com</a> </li>
   <li> <a href=http://home.elp.rr.com/wolfclan/alchemy/alchemyindex.html>Belgar's Ultimate Guide to Alchemy</a> </li>
   <li> <a href=http://www.eqportal.com/tinkering/recipes.html> Fulcrum's Tinkering Compendium</a> </li>
</ol>
Coming soon, Guild Crafters Listing.


<p> Are you a crafter looking for those hard to find components, or are you the bold 
hunter who has discovered some rare or unusual item? Check <a href=itemlist.asp>here</a>  for a list 
of items our crafters may be interested in.
</p>

